#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:85
msgid "Power pins"
msgstr "电源引脚"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:87
msgid ""
"**3.3V** — regulated 3.3 V rail. Up to 250 mA available for shields (less if"
" the microSD card is in use). Unlike the newer cameras this pin is "
"bidirectional — see the warning below."
msgstr ""
"**3.3V** —— 经稳压的 3.3 V 电源轨。可为扩展板提供最高 250 mA（使用 microSD "
"卡时会更少）。与较新的摄像头不同，此引脚是双向的 —— 参见下方的警告。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:90
msgid ""
"**VIN** — 3.6 – 5 V input. Powers the board through the on‑board regulator."
msgstr "**VIN** —— 3.6 – 5 V 输入。通过板载稳压器为开发板供电。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:92
msgid "**GND** — common ground."
msgstr "**GND** —— 公共地。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:96
msgid ""
"When both USB and VIN are present, whichever has the **higher voltage** "
"powers the board — the on‑board diodes simply pick the stronger rail."
msgstr "当 USB 与 VIN 同时存在时，\\ **电压更高**\\ 的一方为开发板供电 —— 板载二极管会自动选取更强的电源轨。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:102
msgid ""
"You **may** power the M4 by feeding 3.3 V directly into the ``3.3V`` pin if "
"you don't want to go through the on‑board regulator. In that case, **do not "
"also apply VIN or USB power at the same time** — back‑driving the regulator "
"while another supply is active can permanently damage and destroy the "
"camera."
msgstr ""
"如果你不想经过板载稳压器，\\ **可以**\\ 直接向 ``3.3V`` 引脚馈入 3.3 V 来为 M4 供电。在这种情况下，\\ "
"**切勿同时再施加 VIN 或 USB 电源** —— 在另一路电源处于活动状态时反向驱动稳压器会永久损坏并破坏摄像头。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:110
msgid ""
"Use the :doc:`battery life estimator <../tutorial/tools/battery-life-"
"estimator>` to model how long the M4 will run on a battery for a given "
"active / deep-sleep duty cycle."
msgstr ""
"使用 :doc:`电池续航估算器 <../tutorial/tools/battery-life-estimator>` "
"可以针对给定的工作/深度睡眠占空比，估算 M4 在电池供电下能运行多久。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:115
msgid "Recovery and debug pins"
msgstr "恢复与调试引脚"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:117
msgid ""
"**RESET** — pull to GND to reset the board. Releasing it lets the MCU start "
"up normally."
msgstr "**RESET** —— 拉低至 GND 以复位开发板。释放后 MCU 即可正常启动。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:119
msgid ""
"**BOOT0** — pull to 3.3 V while powering the board to enter the STM32 ROM "
"bootloader (DFU mode). OpenMV IDE uses this mode to reflash the on‑board "
"bootloader."
msgstr ""
"**BOOT0** —— 在为开发板上电时拉高至 3.3 V，即可进入 STM32 ROM 引导加载程序（DFU 模式）。OpenMV IDE "
"使用此模式来重新刷写板载引导加载程序。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:123
msgid ""
"SWCLK and SWDIO are broken out as ordinary header pins (not a dedicated SWD "
"connector). Wire RESET, SWCLK, SWDIO, GND, and 3.3 V to an ST‑LINK or SEGGER"
" J‑Link adapter to debug the board."
msgstr ""
"SWCLK 与 SWDIO 以普通排针引脚形式引出（不是专用的 SWD 接口）。将 RESET、SWCLK、SWDIO、GND 和 3.3 V 接到 "
"ST‑LINK 或 SEGGER J‑Link 适配器即可调试开发板。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:128
msgid "Onboard peripherals"
msgstr "板载外设"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:131
msgid "LEDs"
msgstr "LED"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:133
msgid ""
"The M4 has a single user RGB LED plus a pair of high‑power 850 nm IR LEDs:"
msgstr "M4 拥有一颗用户 RGB LED 以及一对大功率 850 nm 红外 LED："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:136
msgid ""
"**User RGB LED** — software‑controllable, exposed as ``LED_RED``, "
"``LED_GREEN`` and ``LED_BLUE``::"
msgstr ""
"**用户 RGB LED** —— 可由软件控制，以 ``LED_RED``\\ 、\\ ``LED_GREEN`` 和 ``LED_BLUE`` "
"形式引出::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:145
msgid ""
"**IR LEDs** — both LEDs are driven together through the ``LED_IR`` pin. "
"``LED_IR`` is wired **active high** in hardware while the firmware treats "
"every other on‑board LED as active low, so use :meth:`~machine.Pin.low` / "
":meth:`~machine.Pin.high` rather than :meth:`~machine.LED.on` / "
":meth:`~machine.LED.off` (which would invert the sense)::"
msgstr ""
"**红外 LED** —— 两颗 LED 通过 ``LED_IR`` 引脚一起驱动。\\ ``LED_IR`` 在硬件上接线为\\ "
"**高电平有效**\\ ，而固件将其他所有板载 LED 视为低电平有效，因此请使用 :meth:`~machine.Pin.low` / "
":meth:`~machine.Pin.high` 而非 :meth:`~machine.LED.on` / "
":meth:`~machine.LED.off`\\ （后者会反转电平含义）::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:159
msgid "Camera sensor"
msgstr "摄像头传感器"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:161
msgid ""
"The bundled sensor (OV7725 on standard boards, OV2640 on very early "
"variants) is driven through the :doc:`/library/omv.csi` module::"
msgstr ""
"随附的传感器（标准开发板上为 OV7725，极早期变体上为 OV2640）通过 :doc:`/library/omv.csi` 模块驱动::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:175
msgid ""
"The sensor is **soldered to the board** on the M4 — it is not on a swappable"
" module."
msgstr "M4 上的传感器是\\ **焊接在板上的** —— 它不在可更换的模块上。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:180
msgid ""
"On **OV7725** boards the sensor's **FSIN** (frame‑sync) pin is wired to the "
"MCU but firmware support for it has not been added."
msgstr "在 **OV7725** 开发板上，传感器的 **FSIN**\\ （帧同步）引脚已接到 MCU，但尚未加入对它的固件支持。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:183
msgid ""
"On **OV2640** boards the sensor's **STROBE**, **FREX** (frame exposure), and"
" **EXPST** (exposure reset) pins are wired to the MCU but firmware support "
"for them has not been added."
msgstr ""
"在 **OV2640** 开发板上，传感器的 **STROBE**\\ 、\\ **FREX**\\ （帧曝光）和 **EXPST**\\ "
"（曝光复位）引脚已接到 MCU，但尚未加入对它们的固件支持。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:188
msgid "Servo headers"
msgstr "舵机排针"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:190
msgid ""
"The back side of the board has two **servo connector solder pads** that "
"break out the standard 3‑pin servo header (signal / VIN / GND) for **P7** "
"and **P8**. The signal pins map straight to TIM4 channels 1 and 2 (the same "
"channels used by :ref:`pyb.Servo <pyb.Servo>`), and the V+ pin on each "
"header is wired directly to **VIN**, so the servos draw their current from "
"the input rail rather than the 3.3 V regulator."
msgstr ""
"开发板背面有两组\\ **舵机连接器焊盘**\\ ，为 **P7** 和 **P8** 引出标准的 3 针舵机排针（信号 / VIN / "
"GND）。信号引脚直接映射到 TIM4 的通道 1 和通道 2（即 :ref:`pyb.Servo <pyb.Servo>` 所用的通道），每组排针上的"
" V+ 引脚直接接到 **VIN**\\ ，因此舵机的电流取自输入电源轨，而非 3.3 V 稳压器。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:198
msgid ""
"Solder a pair of right‑angle 3‑pin headers into the pads and connect two "
"hobby servos to drive a pan‑and‑tilt mount::"
msgstr "将一对直角 3 针排针焊入焊盘，并连接两个业余级舵机来驱动云台::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:209
msgid "microSD card"
msgstr "microSD 卡"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:211
msgid ""
"When a card is inserted it is mounted automatically at ``/sdcard`` and is "
"usable through the regular file system::"
msgstr "插入卡后，它会自动挂载到 ``/sdcard``\\ ，可通过常规文件系统使用::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:220
msgid "Bus reference"
msgstr "总线参考"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:223
msgid "GPIO"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:225
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`machine.Pin <machine.Pin>` to read or drive any of the "
"silkscreened pins. Outputs are 3.3 V CMOS, **5 V tolerant on the input "
"side**, and can sink/source up to 25 mA per pin (120 mA total across the "
"whole header)."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`machine.Pin <machine.Pin>` 来读取或驱动任意丝印引脚。输出为 3.3 V CMOS 电平，\\ **输入侧耐"
" 5 V**\\ ，每个引脚可灌入/拉出最高 25 mA（整个排针合计 120 mA）。"

